  m_Text: 'You will have to show your dexterity and reaction speed! Each level you
    will see a combination of multi-colored candies that you need to collect from
    those offered at the top of the screen in a limited time. But be careful - every
    wrong answer reduces the current time even faster!

    Your task is to quickly
    and accurately click on the candies that match the given combination to successfully
    complete the level. The faster you act, the greater your chances of completing
    all levels and breaking records!'
